      "headers": [
        "Old world",
        "Rust",
        "Difference"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "C# `Func<>` / `Action<>` / lambda",
          "closure + `Fn`/`FnMut`/`FnOnce`",
          "Capture mode is part of the type, checked"
